label "Mode 1, distributed agentic memory: an agent reads a node's items, graph and tools, writes through a proposal (highlighted) that a human ratifies before it reaches the store, and walks peer nodes itself"
caption "Reads are open; the highlighted write path always passes through a human before anything is stored."
region node 16 20 200 210 "a node (this site, or yours)"
box store 30 40 172 44 "items + graph + llms.txt"
box tools 30 100 172 44 "read: tools, graph, chunks"
box propose 30 160 172 44 "write: proposal" acc
box agent 300 96 130 48 "agent"
box human 300 176 130 44 "human ratifies"
box peer 300 20 130 44 "peer node"
arrow agent tools
arrow agent propose
arrow propose human
arrow human store dashed via=250,198;250,62
arrow agent peer dashed
note "open reads; every write is a proposal a human merges; nodes never call nodes"
